ReXGlue input: left-stick keys as face buttons (WASD for takedown / QTE diamonds).

With SetStickKeysAsFaceButtons(true) the keys bound to the left stick press the face buttons by
their place on the pad (up Y, left X, down A, right B) and move nothing. A game turns it on while
a button-press sequence drawn as the pad diamond is up (007: quick-kill takedowns), so W A S D
answer it. Off by default; keyboard only (a real pad is untouched).

